                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Aye iwe omuntu wulirisa kye ndi kukukoba: otaba mudheemu ng'oti ni beene. Kola oyasame, olye kye nja okukugha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.8",
